                <zone fixed-size='234' h='30317' id='31' is-fixed='true' name='04 - Channel ROAS &amp; ROI Analysis' w='49549' x='49968' y='37955'>
                  <layout-cache fixed-size-h='250' minwidth='204' type-h='fixed' type-w='scalable' />
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='149' forceUpdate='true' h='18449' id='35' type-v2='text' w='99034' x='483' y='68272'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>MARKETING BUDGET RECOMMENDATIONS</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>Improve Campaign Tracking</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>Prioritize consistent campaign tagging and GA4 campaign mapping. Six of the eight advertising campaigns currently lack verified campaign-level attribution.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>Avoid Premature Budget Reallocation</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>Do not increase or reduce channel budgets based solely on currently available ROAS figures. Paid Search is the only channel with measurable attributed revenue under the current mapping.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>Identify Campaigns for Further Evaluation</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>Use click-through rate, simulated conversions, and cost per simulated conversion to identify campaigns worth investigating. These are preliminary indicators, not verified customer acquisition or profitability metrics.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>Validate Performance Before Scaling</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>Improve campaign ID, UTM, GA4, and advertising spend mapping. Once tracking is reliable, evaluate actual CPA, ROAS, and profitability before reallocating budgets.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>OVERALL RECOMMENDATION</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>Maintain existing budget allocations until campaign tracking and attribution coverage improve. Prioritize measurement reliability before making data-driven budget optimization decisions.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='65' forceUpdate='true' h='8578' id='36' type-v2='text' w='99034' x='483' y='86721'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>MEASUREMENT LIMITATION</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>Advertising performance includes synthetic campaign metrics. Campaign-level GA4 revenue mapping remains unverified for six of eight campaigns. Channel-level attributed revenue and ROAS are currently measurable only for Paid Search. ROAS is revenue-based and does not represent profit or incremental return. Null values indicate unavailable measurement, not zero performance.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
